sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Browser
    participant Web as web/app.py
    participant Store as Local files
    participant Writer as CLI writer + ad_prompt
    participant API as Selected text API
    participant Build as cli.build_one
    participant Voice as voice.py
    participant Video as render.py + subtitles.py
    User->>UI: Choose writer and request script or rewrite
    UI->>Web: POST /products/slug/script with current draft and notes
    Web->>Store: Load product and brand facts
    Store-->>Web: Configuration and media paths
    Web->>Writer: Dispatch with facts and rewrite context
    Writer->>Store: Read fresh photo context / collection snapshot
    Writer->>API: Send shared advertising brief
    API-->>Writer: JSON segments
    Writer->>Writer: Parse, validate and check constraints
    opt Correctable format or copy-rule issue
        Writer->>API: Bounded corrective request
        API-->>Writer: Revised JSON
    end
    opt Hindi with supported AI writer
        Writer->>API: Hindi editing pass with original brief
        API-->>Writer: Edited JSON
        Writer->>Writer: Validate again
    end
    alt Generation succeeded
        Writer-->>Web: Ordered segments
        Web-->>UI: Editable scene rows with photo picks
    else Provider or validation failed
        Writer-->>Web: Error
        Web-->>UI: Explain error and preserve submitted draft
    end
    User->>UI: Edit words, captions and photo selections
    UI->>Web: POST /products/slug/build with edited rows
    Web->>Build: Exact segments and selected filenames
    Build->>Build: Validate media and collection ownership
    Build->>Voice: Synthesize each spoken line
    Voice-->>Build: Clips, measured durations, optional word timings
    Build->>Video: Plan timing, create captions and compose shots
    Video->>Store: Write MP4
    Build->>Store: Write posting caption
    Build-->>Web: Output paths
    Web-->>UI: Video preview, downloads and caption
